WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.200
-For two days,
the nation was paralyzed

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.601
by an existential crisis,

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.200
the likes of which this country
has never seen,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.300
a crisis so dire,
it threatened our institutions,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.734
our political system,
our very way of life.

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.634
A waking nightmare that has left
us frightened and confused.

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.701
A watershed moment that has
changed America forever.

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:17.701
There was a balloon.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.934
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:25.000
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.534
By now, no doubt, you've heard
about the Chinese spy balloon.

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.067
It flew across the
continental U.S.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.234
and monopolized the media's
attention for days

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:33.501
and it made
an electrifying appearance

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.234
at last night's Grammys.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:38.667
Well, it electrified everyone
but Ben Affleck.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.167
[ Laughter ]
How can you drink
that much Dunkin' coffee

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.934
and still look like
someone stole his bike?

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.934
[ Laughter ]
Anyway,

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:46.901
the balloon was all anybody
could talk about

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.901
after it was spotted
in the sky on Thursday

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:51.300
and made quite a trip
across U.S. airspace.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.968
-The balloon has traveled
for days

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:55.000
from Western Alaska
to the Midwest.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.868
-It traveled thousands of miles
across the United States.

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:03.334
-It started in Alaska,
Aleutian Islands, Alaska,

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:05.934
and then came
down through Canada

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:09.701
and it just crossed into the
United States in Montana.

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:11.667
-It was spotted here
in Billings Wednesday

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.701
and is still on the move
this morning,

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.367
hovering over the Northern U.S.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:18.133
-The balloon is likely
somewhere over Kansas

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.834
after sightings
over Montana yesterday.

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:23.934
-It drifted across Nebraska
and then into the Midwest today,

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:26.200
spotted as it made its way
across Missouri.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.734
-From Idaho to Montana,

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:29.434
all the way
down to the Carolinas.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:31.601
-It was about six nautical miles
off the coast

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:34.200
near Myrtle Beach,
South Carolina.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.033
-First of all, we should stop
calling it a Chinese spy balloon

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.868
when a far more accurate name is

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:40.801
[bleep] Chinese spy balloon.

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.601
The only way this balloon
could've had a higher profile is

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:46.601
if it had its own
Instagram account.

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:54.467
[ Laughter ]
This balloon did more traveling
than a high school senior

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:55.801
taking a gap year
before college.

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.734
[ Laughter ]
True story -- it already has

00:01:57.734 --> 00:01:59.868
Diamond Medallion status
on Delta.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.133 --> 00:02:02.901
Next time it's spotted
in American airspace,

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:04.200
it's going to be in first class.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.868
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:11.901
Writers all day were like,
"A balloon in a first-class seat

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:12.934
with a glass of champagne,"

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:13.968
and our graphics department
was like,

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:15.100
"Alright, [bleep] it,
I don't know

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.801
[ Laughter ]
what that looks like.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:20.367
I feel like your job is way
easier than my job."

00:02:20.367 --> 00:02:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:24.400
There's something about it
being a balloon

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.601
that just makes it very hard
to take seriously.

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:29.267
Like it would be one thing
to send a fleet of fighter jets

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:30.534
or a giant naval vessel.

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:32.133
That would be scary.
But a balloon?

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:35.133
Are they trying to scare us
or cheer us up at the hospital?

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:39.000
[ Laughter ]
We should respond with something
even dumber to flummox them.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.334
Like we should send one
of those air dancers they have

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:43.334
outside car dealerships...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:46.167
...you know, but undercover,
with a wig and a mustache.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:47.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:50.501
I do like to imagine him
as a British spy working for MI6

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:52.367
in a joint operation
with the CIA.

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:54.400
[ English accent ]
Your mission is to infiltrate
the Chinese Army

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.534
and gather intelligence on their
most closely guarded secret.

00:02:57.534 --> 00:02:59.234
You think you can handle that,
old chap?

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.267
"You've got it!"

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:03.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.133
So, the balloon thing was all

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:05.567
anyone could talk about
for days.

00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:08.601
But it was an especially
big hit on Fox News,

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.334
whose human news balloons

00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:12.133
could not stop
obsessing over it.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:14.300
-There is a Chinese spy balloon

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.067
floating over America right now.

00:03:16.067 --> 00:03:18.767
-A high-altitude
Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.100
-There is, by the way,
a Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.267
-A Chinese by balloon.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.601
-A Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:22.667 --> 00:03:24.801
-A Chinese spy balloon.
-Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:26.567
-Chinese spy balloon.
-Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:28.033
-Chinese spy balloon.
-Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.501
-Chinese spy balloon.
-Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.033
-Chinese spy balloon.
-Chinese spy balloon.

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:31.934
-Balloon.
-Balloon.
-Balloon.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:32.767
-Balloon.
-Balloon.
-Balloon.

00:03:32.834 --> 00:03:34.000
-Balloon.
-Balloon.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.734
[ Laughter ]
-An entire network

00:03:35.734 --> 00:03:37.100
became obsessed
with the balloon,

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.934
like a five-year-old
at a birthday party.

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:41.367
Just to screw with Fox News,

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:43.234
Biden should've announced
that he was inviting the balloon

00:03:43.234 --> 00:03:45.534
to appear in this year's
Thanksgiving Day Parade.

00:03:45.534 --> 00:03:46.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.534
The speculation on the right got
so fevered and out of control

00:03:49.534 --> 00:03:50.934
that Republicans
and Fox personalities

00:03:50.934 --> 00:03:53.000
started taking wild guesses

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.200
about what might be
inside the balloon.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.000
-My concern is that
the federal government,

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.934
obviously, doesn't know what's
in that balloon.

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:02.667
Is that bioweapons
in that balloon?

00:04:02.667 --> 00:04:05.400
Is it? Did that balloon
take off from Wuhan?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.934
[ Laughter ]
-The next balloon might be
filled with another virus.

00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:09.701
Pop!
Droplets all over.

00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:11.100
We're all on ventilators again.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.601
[ Laughter ]
-There's a lot
of devastating weapons

00:04:12.601 --> 00:04:14.567
that could be delivered
this way,

00:04:14.567 --> 00:04:17.601
to include
electromagnetic pulse, EMP.

00:04:17.601 --> 00:04:20.400
-Did it drop and disperse
surveillance products

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.200
powered by solar energy
to allow unlimited surveillance?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.267
[ Laughter ]
-I don't know.

00:04:25.267 --> 00:04:25.968
Probably not?

00:04:25.968 --> 00:04:28.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:30.534 --> 00:04:32.400
These people were so scared
of a balloon,

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.734
you would think it was floating
out of a sewer grate.

00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:36.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.467
[ As Bartiromo ]
Was it filled with a virus,
a bioweapon,

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:39.934
an electromagnetic pulse?

00:04:39.934 --> 00:04:42.100
Did it drop solar-powered
surveillance products

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.868
in everyone's house,
so they can spy on you

00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:46.334
while you drink box wine
and watch "Real Housewives"?

00:04:46.334 --> 00:04:48.067
[ Laughter ]
Or maybe it's filled
with delicious candy,

00:04:48.067 --> 00:04:49.968
piñata-style,
and, if that's the case,

00:04:49.968 --> 00:04:51.667
[ Laughter ]
why isn't Biden
shooting it down?

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:53.601
Is he waiting for it
to drift over Delaware,

00:04:53.601 --> 00:04:55.400
so he can keep all the candy
for himself?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.868
[ Laughter ]
We deserve answers

00:04:56.868 --> 00:04:59.267
and we deserve delicious candy!

00:04:59.267 --> 00:05:01.567
[ Laughter ]
And yet, the dumbest
speculation was

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:03.400
the incessant questioning,
over and over,

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.033
of why Biden wouldn't just
shoot down the balloon

00:05:06.033 --> 00:05:08.467
while it drifted
over the continental U.S.

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:11.868
-Why haven't we shot
this balloon out of the sky?

00:05:11.868 --> 00:05:14.267
Oh, Joe Biden is the president.

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:16.033
-I can nearly guarantee you
that that balloon

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:18.267
would still not be flying,
if we were still there.

00:05:18.267 --> 00:05:20.167
-Why did it take
U.S. officials

00:05:20.167 --> 00:05:22.100
so long
to shoot it down?

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.534
-You have to wonder
why isn't our military

00:05:25.534 --> 00:05:27.133
doing anything about it?

00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:29.834
And it elicits
so many questions.

00:05:29.834 --> 00:05:31.834
I think about Joe Biden.

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:33.133
Is Joe Biden compromised?

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:36.267
Is that why he won't allow
the military to do it?

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:39.133
There's a lot in that laptop
that might have something to do

00:05:39.133 --> 00:05:41.000
[ Laughter ]
with this response as well.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.100
-That's right,
they think Biden waited

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.267
to shoot down the balloon,

00:05:44.267 --> 00:05:45.801
not because the debris
might crash on land

00:05:45.801 --> 00:05:47.868
and potentially cause harm
or distraction to Americans,

00:05:47.868 --> 00:05:49.734
but because
of Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:05:49.734 --> 00:05:52.167
As far as I'm aware,
the only balloon associated

00:05:52.167 --> 00:05:54.767
with Hunter's laptop is
the balloon who found it.

00:05:54.767 --> 00:05:57.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.133
In their minds, what do they
think was going on here?

00:05:59.133 --> 00:06:01.467
Biden's son Hunter was, somehow,
compromised by China,

00:06:01.467 --> 00:06:03.968
so, in return,
Joe Biden made a secret deal

00:06:03.968 --> 00:06:06.901
with the Chinese government
to allow them to fly a giant,

00:06:06.901 --> 00:06:10.100
super visible, balloon
over the country for a few days

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.534
before shooting it down.
If that's the case,

00:06:11.534 --> 00:06:13.067
I think it's actually
a terrible story for China

00:06:13.067 --> 00:06:14.767
because that is a very bad deal.

00:06:14.767 --> 00:06:17.334
"We've informed President Biden
of the dirt we have on his son.

00:06:17.334 --> 00:06:18.667
He was willing to make a trade."

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:21.133
Excellent news.
What did we get?

00:06:21.133 --> 00:06:25.033
Copies of top secret documents,
access to their nuclear secrets?

00:06:25.033 --> 00:06:26.400
"No.
Something even better.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.267
We got balloon access!

00:06:28.267 --> 00:06:29.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.834 --> 00:06:32.467
Three days' worth!"

00:06:32.467 --> 00:06:34.267
Alright, I think we need
a new negotiator.

00:06:34.267 --> 00:06:37.734
[ Laughter ]
Also, you guys think Biden's the
one who's compromised by China?

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:40.300
Trump and his daughter Ivanka
had Chinese trademarks approved

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.667
while they were working
in the White House.

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:43.033
Trump had a business pursuit

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:44.567
and a secret bank account
in China.

00:06:44.567 --> 00:06:47.868
In fact, Trump paid nearly
$200,000 in taxes to China

00:06:47.868 --> 00:06:49.634
over several years,
while, in 2020,

00:06:49.634 --> 00:06:51.400
he paid no income taxes
in the U.S.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.701
And I know the right is upset
about the idea

00:06:53.701 --> 00:06:55.601
that we would hire
more IRS agents,

00:06:55.601 --> 00:06:58.100
but it does seem to say a lot
about our tax system

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.501
that Donald Trump
could easily evade taxes here,

00:07:00.501 --> 00:07:02.601
but still had
to pay them in China.

00:07:02.601 --> 00:07:05.000
[ Laughter ]
"Sir, we have to file our taxes
with the U.S."

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.234
[ As Trump ]
Tell them I owe them zilch.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:07.234
They won't do [bleep].

00:07:07.234 --> 00:07:08.801
It's just one guy
and he's so tired.

00:07:08.801 --> 00:07:10.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.234 --> 00:07:11.334
"And what about China?"

00:07:11.334 --> 00:07:12.601
[ As Trump ]
Oh, send them every penny.

00:07:12.601 --> 00:07:13.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.901 --> 00:07:16.334
I would hate to lose access
to my TikTok account.

00:07:16.334 --> 00:07:17.467
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:19.501
I finally learned
all the dances!

00:07:19.501 --> 00:07:21.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.234 --> 00:07:22.767
In fact, just to give you
an idea of how stupid

00:07:22.767 --> 00:07:24.467
the right-wing discourse
about this balloon has been,

00:07:24.467 --> 00:07:26.000
multiple GOP politicians,

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.734
from former Secretary of State
Mike Pompeo

00:07:27.734 --> 00:07:29.067
to Congressman Paul Gosar,

00:07:29.067 --> 00:07:31.634
to failed Arizona gubernatorial
candidate Kari Lake,

00:07:31.634 --> 00:07:34.334
to Ohio Senator J.D. Vance
posted photos of themselves

00:07:34.334 --> 00:07:35.767
pointing guns in the sky,

00:07:35.767 --> 00:07:37.100
[ Laughter ]
implying that they

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.133
could shoot down the balloon
themselves.

00:07:39.133 --> 00:07:41.501
My favorite one of these is
Yale-educated,

00:07:41.501 --> 00:07:44.434
Silicon Valley venture
capitalist J.D. Vance cosplaying

00:07:44.434 --> 00:07:45.968
as one of the dudes
from "Duck Dynasty."

00:07:45.968 --> 00:07:47.868
[ Laughter ]
No one's buying
your shtick, dude.

00:07:47.868 --> 00:07:50.200
Look at the freshly purchased
Bengals hoodie.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.234
You just know the tag is still
on that.

00:07:52.234 --> 00:07:54.968
[ Laughter ]
You look like a Hollywood
wannabe auditioning

00:07:54.968 --> 00:07:56.467
for a remake of "Deliverance."

00:07:56.467 --> 00:07:57.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.767 --> 00:07:59.267
And then, of course,
there are a bunch of Republicans

00:07:59.267 --> 00:08:01.267
who claim the dumb balloon saga

00:08:01.267 --> 00:08:03.601
would never have happened
under Donald Trump,

00:08:03.601 --> 00:08:05.234
with some even going so far
as to claim that,

00:08:05.234 --> 00:08:07.734
if it did happen, Trump would've
shot down the balloon
immediately.

00:08:07.734 --> 00:08:08.601
Lauren Boebert tweeted...

00:08:11.534 --> 00:08:12.901
And Marjorie Taylor Greene
tweeted...

00:08:24.234 --> 00:08:26.634
Based on the kind words
Trump always had to say

00:08:26.634 --> 00:08:28.000
about foreign adversaries,
I think,

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.868
if a Chinese spy balloon
had flown

00:08:29.868 --> 00:08:31.767
over U.S. soil
during his presidency,

00:08:31.767 --> 00:08:33.267
Trump would've tried
to befriend it.

00:08:33.267 --> 00:08:36.234
He'd be telling stories about it
at his rallies to this day.

00:08:36.234 --> 00:08:37.400
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ]
When I was president,

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.567
I got along great
with all the floating vessels --

00:08:39.567 --> 00:08:43.334
Zeppelins, airships, dirigibles.

00:08:43.334 --> 00:08:44.434
[ Laughter ]
I love the dirigibles.

00:08:44.434 --> 00:08:46.367
The dirigibles love Trump
and, of course --

00:08:46.367 --> 00:08:47.167
[ Laughter ]

00:08:47.167 --> 00:08:48.167
and of course, the balloon.

00:08:48.167 --> 00:08:49.734
We love the balloon,
don't we, folks?

00:08:49.734 --> 00:08:52.334
[ Laughter ]
I remember I was
in the Oval Office one day

00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:54.200
when a Chinese spy balloon,
it floated down,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.100
floated through the window.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.400
Big balloon, strong balloon.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.100
[ Laughter ]

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.400
Tears pouring
down its latex face

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.968
[ Laughter ]
and it said to me, it said --

00:09:01.968 --> 00:09:03.634
[ Squeaking ]

00:09:03.634 --> 00:09:05.767
[ Balloon farting ]

00:09:05.767 --> 00:09:08.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.801 --> 00:09:10.601
And I said, "It's so true.
It's so true."

00:09:10.601 --> 00:09:13.100
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:13.901
But you know what?
They're right.

00:09:13.901 --> 00:09:16.167
This would've never, ever, ever,

00:09:16.167 --> 00:09:18.000
ever happened
under Donald Trump.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.067
-U.S. officials tell Fox
it's not the first time

00:09:21.067 --> 00:09:24.834
Chinese spy balloons have flown
over the United States.

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:26.267
About four months ago,

00:09:26.267 --> 00:09:29.834
a Chinese spy balloon crashed
in the Pacific near Hawaii.

00:09:29.834 --> 00:09:32.767
Others were spotted
over Texas and Florida,

00:09:32.767 --> 00:09:35.000
dating back to the Trump
administration,

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.534
but never previously
acknowledged publicly.

00:09:37.534 --> 00:09:39.434
-That's right,
they flew balloons under Trump.

00:09:39.434 --> 00:09:41.834
Even worse,
they flew them at Mar-a-Lago.

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:43.067
[ Laughter ]

00:09:43.067 --> 00:09:44.901
The incredibly dumb balloon
melodramas exposed

00:09:44.901 --> 00:09:46.267
just how vacuous and silly

00:09:46.267 --> 00:09:48.367
so much of the right-wing media
discourse is, these days.

00:09:48.367 --> 00:09:50.033
They all lost their minds
over a balloon,

00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:51.601
demanding that it be shot
down immediately

00:09:51.601 --> 00:09:53.601
without any thought
of the potential consequences

00:09:53.601 --> 00:09:55.834
and implying there was
some dark conspiracy at play.

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:58.000
And then, once Biden
did have it shot down,

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.534
he contradicted their talking
points and burst their...

00:10:00.534 --> 00:10:01.601
-Balloon.

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:03.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:05.334
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:05.334 --> 00:10:08.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

